Record types are requirement, question, decision, scope, goal, persona, journey, screen, component, interface, entity, work-package, and constraint. Use only those needed. There is no evidence record type. Evidence is a `perspective` value, alongside intent and solution, on any of these types. `home` names a scope ID. `contains` links scope nodes. Other links include informed-by, depends-on, appears-in, fulfilled-by, uses, and relates-to. Supersession links are managed by the decision operation.
